==In the manga==
[[File:Drake Dragonite EToP.png|thumb|150px|Dragonite in [[The Electric Tale of Pikachu]]]]
===The Electric Tale of Pikachu===
Dragonite makes an appearance in ''[[ET18|Pikachu's Plan]]'', where it was the last Pokémon Drake used to battle {{OBP|Ash Ketchum|EToP|Ash}}. It went up against {{AP|Squirtle}} as its first opponent and won easily. {{AP|Charizard}} was next, and after a long battle, Dragonite emerged victorious. Lastly, it battled {{AP|Pikachu|Pikachu (EToP)}} and lost when Pikachu crawled into its mouth and used {{m|Thunder}}, giving Ash the victory.

